<title>USA: Rogers Corp to buy Dow Corning business.</title>
<headline>Rogers Corp to buy Dow Corning business.</headline>
<dateline>ROGERS, Conn. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rogers Corp said Thursday it has reached a definitive agreement to purchase Dow Corning Corp's Bisco Products business.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The transaction is expected to close at the end of the year.</p>
<p>Bisco products, based in Elk Grove Village, Ill, is a manufacturer of silicone foam materials.</p>
<p>Rogers Corp develops and manufactures specialty materials and components for use in industrial markets, such as elastomer materials and components.</p>
</text>
